B.ajH=s(["Rebuilt the GitHub Pages production app from the primary source and restored Supabase sign-in and synchronization.","Changed the PWA cache identity so phones and PCs discard the accidentally published local-demo build.","Completed the public website, Supabase, and Web Push build settings required by production."],t.s)
