B.ai6=s(["Fixed the large gray block that appeared in the assistant schedule preview on iPhone Web/PWA, which hid the lower part of the card.","Replaced the reminder area with a more stable custom layout instead of the mobile browser rendering path that was stretching incorrectly.","Kept the default reminder behavior, auto-filled schedule defaults, and moved mobile notification settings into the account menu."],t.s)
